<% page_title "About" %>
<header class="page-head"><div class="wrap narrow"><p class="eyebrow">About</p><h1>Learn it from the beginning.</h1></div></header>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap narrow prose">
  <p><%= brand.name %> started as one person's study plan. <%= brand.founder %>, the founder, did a coding bootcamp years ago and found that very little stuck. So he started over, from the beginning, and built the school he wished he'd had: a tutor for each subject, one step at a time, real projects, and honest feedback.</p>
  <p>He built it with AI, and he's its first student. The courses here are the parts of that structure that help other people most: practical AI workflows and agentic AI.</p>

  <h2 id="honest">Our tutors are characters, played by AI</h2>
  <p>Prof. Tomas Reyes, Dean Ada Whitfield and the rest of the <%= brand.name %> faculty are AI personas. Each one has a name, a teaching style and a rubric, because that makes learning more human and more consistent. They aren't real people, and we never present them as human experts. <%= brand.founder %> designs every course and stands behind it.</p>

  <h2>What we believe</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Say the true thing first.</strong> That goes for feedback on your work, our claims and this page.</li>
    <li><strong>Build, don't watch.</strong> You learn by typing it yourself.</li>
    <li><strong>Honest feedback.</strong> Redo any lesson as often as you like. Your tutor will tell you plainly when work isn't there yet.</li>
    <li><strong>No credential theater.</strong> <%= brand.name %> is not accredited and doesn't grant degrees or academic credit. You leave with skills and a portfolio that shows them.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Part of <%= brand.parent %></h2>
  <p><%= brand.name %> is the education arm of <%= brand.parent_url ? link_to(brand.parent, brand.parent_url) : brand.parent %>, <%= brand.founder %>'s business.</p>
  <p><strong>Founder:</strong> <%= brand.founder_full_name || brand.founder %>, founder and student number one. <%= link_to "Executive consulting", consulting_path %></p>
</div></section>
